# Varuna Point Remade's fuel-spill gallery with a work suit (CIPlay varuna_point_remade_acidsuit, 11-12 w13; in a test world 'CI ...'; offline-written, NOT yet run).
# The suit box (vpfuelsuits at -17.2 -68.6) gives 180 s of suit; into the gallery to the fuel-line locker and back, unhurt.
# Run in a fresh world after the acid play. Floor 5.6 m is a GUESS (Raft surface probe).
island Varuna Point Remade keep
offset -0.7903 -5.1702
hour 11
weather Calm
walk -25 -69.6 to -17 -69.4 below=14
use vpfuelsuits
walk -18 -69.4 to -20 -66 to -22.2 -62.4
wait 6
expect unhurt
open Fuel-line locker
wait 2
expect item Bolt 3
picture vp_acid_in -21 8 -65 -22.6 6 -61.8 light=20
walk -22.2 -62.4 to -20 -66 to -18 -69.4 to -25 -69.6
expect unhurt
